  "description": "CR 207.2c, 603.2, 709.5i, 613.4b: Entity Tracker draws and Erratic Apparition gets +1/+1 when an enchantment their controller controls enters and when that player fully unlocks a Room, and Porcelain Gallery sets its controller's creatures' base power and toughness to the number of creatures they control",
  "note": "Ornithopter (an artifact creature) and bob's Fresh Start (an enchantment bob controls) enter without triggering either eerie ability. Casting Dollmaker's Shop fires both once; paying {4}{W}{W} to unlock Porcelain Gallery fully unlocks the Room and fires both again. Alice controls four creatures, bob's Grizzly Bears not counted, so each of hers has base 4/4: the Apparition 6/6 with two pumps, Fresh Start's -5/-0 applying after the base set on Savannah Lions. The pumps end with the turn.",
